{"date":"2025-03-20","startIndex":0,"messages":[{"id":"m_d1c2d3697ecc78e05dfc7580b109cbfd","sender":"her","text":"今天的风有一点像刚洗好的被子。","timestamp":1742463000,"time":"17:30:00","type":"文本","kind":"text","quote":{"sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","target":{"date":"2025-03-17","chunk":0,"id":"m_8ca5562a4eda8b3f6018c47af348f60d"}}},{"id":"m_1c080a5e1c6e0f00e4bdeddf81169be2","sender":"me","text":"那我们把窗户开一小会儿。","timestamp":1742463037,"time":"17:30:37","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_1daae8f208b6498722fee1cbd3917ae5","sender":"her","text":"路过一家小花店，想起你喜欢的颜色。","timestamp":1742463074,"time":"17:31:14","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_5690d698924f12d9df29f057f5f720d0","sender":"me","text":"留到周末，我们一起挑一束。","timestamp":1742463111,"time":"17:31:51","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_ccc42ee8f0a1b55af7ce2d5d1d7b1de9","sender":"her","text":"刚煮好的面，第一口最好吃。","timestamp":1742463148,"time":"17:32:28","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_72d8ac0058cc3b3316544483450c6f28","sender":"me","text":"等我两分钟，把葱花也留一点。","timestamp":1742463185,"time":"17:33:05","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_91572575d0112e49f4dace50ac5f5b2d","sender":"her","text":"今天路边的小房子，给你看。（程序插画演示）","timestamp":1742463222,"time":"17:33:42","type":"文本","kind":"image","media":[{"kind":"image","url":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","thumb":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","width":660,"height":528}]},{"id":"m_6117f136f5a263f8819c5f22c2e000ab","sender":"me","text":"你拍下来了吗？","timestamp":1742463259,"time":"17:34:19","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_35b2b93467886c53aef0ae7e87b8b339","sender":"her","text":"拍了一张，有点歪，但是很好看。","timestamp":1742463296,"time":"17:34:56","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_4397e53b43d37d3a541ae0345345d915","sender":"me","text":"歪一点也没关系，是今天的样子。","timestamp":1742463333,"time":"17:35:33","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_d5778030a258d82e8d0841de5e1f9ad5","sender":"her","text":"一声轻轻的提示音。（合成音效，并非真人语音）","timestamp":1742463370,"time":"17:36:10","type":"文本","kind":"audio","media":[{"kind":"audio","url":"chat-assets/f421a82c97894339c36adbd27d366c4d937b8d5ee1df9c80438880f36a5cea43.wav"}]},{"id":"m_3be2f9360f68a8f2bdb9757ce1430034","sender":"me","text":"好，早餐我来准备。","timestamp":1742463407,"time":"17:36:47","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_b3168bd326ae0cb89792d8aa03f58288","sender":"her","text":"柠檬汽水还是要冰冰的。","timestamp":1742463444,"time":"17:37:24","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_536a3bc79028290326c85e0588df0913","sender":"me","text":"我选热可可，我们一人分对方一口。","timestamp":1742463481,"time":"17:38:01","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_6c756a2e6a1da3f786a16cfe7a20624a","sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","timestamp":1742463518,"time":"17:38:38","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_8a5c079bbf05175a77ebe56702fa6875","sender":"me","text":"分享一个占位链接。","timestamp":1742463555,"time":"17:39:15","type":"文本","kind":"text","link":{"url":"https://example.com/","title":"示例链接 · example.com"}},{"id":"m_204a061a92659118ac48b75dfdd6b203","sender":"her","text":"书只看了两页，猫倒是睡了一下午。","timestamp":1742463592,"time":"17:39:52","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_8b8c625a01c318a1ecda2e8d412dd59f","sender":"me","text":"两页也算数，慢慢看。","timestamp":1742463629,"time":"17:40:29","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_002af8de0bec444c0c1a2a586a6b57b3","sender":"her","text":"雨停了，楼下的叶子亮晶晶。","timestamp":1742463666,"time":"17:41:06","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_3d33c96ae6fcc57af2670c82e559286e","sender":"me","text":"穿好外套，我们下楼走走。","timestamp":1742463703,"time":"17:41:43","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_204823df65488c607e0e9930491dd2ee","sender":"her","text":"明天不用赶路，可以绕一点远。","timestamp":1742463740,"time":"17:42:20","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_c2e5dbfd8b27e5fd45588626ee59e25b","sender":"me","text":"听你的，顺路买一袋栗子。","timestamp":1742463777,"time":"17:42:57","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_59f89edd092026ef5bf4d8e7db5ebf68","sender":"her","text":"回家的时候记得抬头，有一弯月亮。","timestamp":1742463814,"time":"17:43:34","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_5d854011beed19e4c09bec1de3b264e9","sender":"me","text":"看见了。晚安，明天再见。","timestamp":1742463851,"time":"17:44:11","type":"文本","kind":"text"}]}
